{"nodes": [{"id": "_context_features_agenda_day_grid_feature", "label": "Feature: arraste na agenda (grade Dia + M\u00eas entre dias)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".context/features/agenda-day-grid.md", "source_location": "topo", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A c\u00e9lula do M\u00eas \u00e9 um dia inteiro (sem eixo de tempo), ent\u00e3o arrastar no M\u00eas s\u00f3 pode mudar a DATA; para mover o hor\u00e1rio, usa-se o Dia. Semana segue lista."}, {"id": "_context_features_agenda_day_grid_daygrid", "label": "DayGrid (grade de horas do modo Dia)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".context/features/agenda-day-grid.md", "source_location": "O que a grade faz", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "HOUR_PX=56, SNAP_MIN=15, faixa 07h-21h expandida para caber itens fora dela; linha do 'agora'; clique em \u00e1rea livre cria com snap 30min."}, {"id": "_context_features_agenda_day_grid_monthview_movekeepingtime", "label": "moveKeepingTime (M\u00eas preserva hora ao trocar de dia)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".context/features/agenda-day-grid.md", "source_location": "Arraste entre dias no modo M\u00eas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Monta a data pelos componentes LOCAIS (ano/m\u00eas/dia do destino + hora/minuto de origem). Nunca somar 24h/addDays no timestamp \u2014 qualquer mudan\u00e7a de offset (hor\u00e1rio de ver\u00e3o) deslocaria o hor\u00e1rio. Hit-test por data-month-day + document.elementFromPoint."}, {"id": "_context_features_agenda_day_grid_dragref_source_of_truth", "label": "dragRef como fonte de verdade do arraste", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".context/features/agenda-day-grid.md", "source_location": "Intera\u00e7\u00e3o de arraste/resize", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O pointerup precisa ler o preview MAIS RECENTE, n\u00e3o o do closure do in\u00edcio do arraste (o onUp lia estado obsoleto). Identidade por key prefixada a:<id>/b:<id> vs entityId cru nos callbacks."}, {"id": "_context_features_agenda_day_grid_click_vs_drag_snap", "label": "Clique \u00d7 arraste decide pela mudan\u00e7a real com snap", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".context/features/agenda-day-grid.md", "source_location": "Intera\u00e7\u00e3o de arraste/resize", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "changed = previewStartMin !== originStartMin (ou dura\u00e7\u00e3o); evita micro-tremor de toque virar reagendamento e PUT no-op com escrita no Google. Regress\u00e3o a evitar: voltar a um limiar de pixels (DRAG_THRESHOLD_PX=4) menor que o passo de snap (~7,5px) reintroduz o bug no mobile."}, {"id": "_context_features_agenda_day_grid_pending_anti_flicker", "label": "pending anti-flicker \u00d7 structural sharing do React Query", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".context/features/agenda-day-grid.md", "source_location": "\u26a0\ufe0f Armadilha: pending precisa de sinal EXPL\u00cdCITO", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Refetch deeply-equal devolve a MESMA refer\u00eancia, ent\u00e3o o efeito por refer\u00eancia nunca dispara quando nada muda no servidor (usu\u00e1rio clicou 'Voltar' no aviso de bloqueio ou a muta\u00e7\u00e3o falhou) e o card ficava preso na posi\u00e7\u00e3o arrastada. Contrato: rescheduleAppointment/rescheduleBlock resolvem s\u00f3 quando a tentativa terminou, nunca rejeitam, e a grade limpa a chave no .finally(). O pai tamb\u00e9m memoiza os arrays (dayGridAppointments/Blocks/GoogleEvents) sen\u00e3o .map() inline limpa o pending cedo."}, {"id": "_context_features_agenda_day_grid_google_event_click", "label": "Clique em evento do Google nas grades", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".context/features/agenda-day-grid.md", "source_location": "Clique num evento do Google", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Feedback do dono 'clico neles e nada acontece': as grades s\u00f3 reportam o id (onSelectGoogleEvent) e a pol\u00edtica vive em handleGoogleEventClick \u2014 promove quando d\u00e1, abre no Google quando n\u00e3o d\u00e1, e toast.info quando n\u00e3o h\u00e1 htmlLink (um if sem else recriaria o sil\u00eancio original). Evento segue n\u00e3o arrast\u00e1vel (firewall)."}, {"id": "_context_features_agenda_day_grid_canpromotegoogleevent", "label": "canPromoteGoogleEvent (regra \u00fanica de promo\u00e7\u00e3o)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".context/features/agenda-day-grid.md", "source_location": "Clique num evento do Google", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dia inteiro n\u00e3o promove (dura\u00e7\u00e3o encaixaria em no m\u00e1x. 8h = mentira silenciosa) e evento particular n\u00e3o promove (nada para pr\u00e9-preencher). Mesma fun\u00e7\u00e3o nas tr\u00eas vis\u00f5es."}, {"id": "_context_features_agenda_day_grid_isprivate_not_label", "label": "'Particular' decide por isPrivate, nunca pelo r\u00f3tulo 'Ocupado'", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".context/features/agenda-day-grid.md", "source_location": "fix de review 2026-07-25", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "'Ocupado' \u00e9 copy pt-BR: renome\u00e1-lo (trabalho do ux-writer) faria evento particular virar promov\u00edvel E parseEventSignals sugerir o pr\u00f3prio r\u00f3tulo como nome do paciente, criando um paciente 'Ocupado' e queimando uma vaga vital\u00edcia de quota. GcalEventDTO passou a carregar isPrivate; regress\u00e3o travada no check MV.4."}, {"id": "_context_features_agenda_day_grid_compact_card", "label": "Card baixo vira 1 linha (COMPACT_CARD_PX)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".context/features/agenda-day-grid.md", "source_location": "Card BAIXO vira 1 linha", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Card de 30 min tem 28px = uma linha; o layout antigo cortava o nome do paciente ('10:00 \u00b7 Pendente' sem dizer de quem). Virou cr\u00edtico quando sobrepor passou a ser permitido (3 colunas = card estreito e baixo)."}, {"id": "_context_features_agenda_day_grid_touch_action_pan_y", "label": "touch-action: pan-y (arraste \u00e9 desktop-first)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".context/features/agenda-day-grid.md", "source_location": "Intera\u00e7\u00e3o de arraste/resize", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No touch um swipe vertical rola a p\u00e1gina (browser assume o gesto e emite pointercancel, que aborta sem editar nem reagendar); no mobile a edi\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 pelo modal (tap). Chrome MCP n\u00e3o redimensiona viewport, ent\u00e3o touch real n\u00e3o foi testado."}, {"id": "_context_features_agenda_day_grid_layoutcolumns", "label": "layoutColumns (colunas de sobreposi\u00e7\u00e3o)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".context/features/agenda-day-grid.md", "source_location": "O que a grade faz", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_context_features_agenda_day_grid_suppressclickref", "label": "suppressClickRef (clique-fantasma p\u00f3s-arraste)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".context/features/agenda-day-grid.md", "source_location": "Intera\u00e7\u00e3o de arraste/resize", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O browser dispara um click sint\u00e9tico no ancestral comum ao fim do arraste, que abriria 'Novo Agendamento'; dragRef j\u00e1 \u00e9 nulo nesse momento, ent\u00e3o h\u00e1 flag dedicada limpada por timeout de 50ms e consumida pelo handleBackgroundClick."}], "edges": [{"source": "_context_features_agenda_day_grid_feature", "target": "_cont